{"type": "say", "text": "Nora, this is Caleb from fire protection. I'm ready to report my findings from the thermal scan I completed during the response. I have some important information about charger C-12 on the same circuit as the incident that needs to be shared before you settle the reopening plan. Should I go ahead and report now?"}
```

