{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF2", "text": "Nora, here are my warehouse logistics findings. My dock inventory check at Dock 2 found exactly 18 outbound pallets currently blocking the safe access route. These pallets must be moved to staging lane S-4 before reopening. I confirmed the lane assignment on the floor map, but dispatch has not yet updated its board."}
